    <title>OpenAI | 走向盈利的战略选择</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66690696c26e396a3622ffa4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66690696c26e396a3622ffa4</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 12 Jun 2024 02:23:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>【栏目介绍】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Strait is the gate and narrow is the way.</span></p><span></span><p><span>大部分人随波逐流以消弭不安、渴望坦途，却也总有小部分人超越周围的因果关系、挤进窄门。我们希望对独特事物做最深度的思考。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【主播介绍】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Daniel，ChatGPT高频使用者，本期策划。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Julian，AI相关产品创业者、前VC投资人，本期剪辑。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【本期起因】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Ilya Sutskever和Jan Leike等OpenAI涉及安全和超级对齐项目的核心人员的离职，以及他们对公司文化和方向的担忧，再加上非贬损离职协议的曝光，促使我们探究OpenAI从非盈利机构到特殊盈利实体的转变背后的原因，也让我们好奇：这家公司是否还记得其AGI的初心？在利益与信仰的旋转门前，我们都在无形中做出选择。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【内容索引】</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">2:03</a> 伊利亚离职和核心团队的变动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="298">4:58</a> 严苛的离职协议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="599">9:59</a> OpenAI成立之初</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="899">14:59</a> AI背后巨大的资源消耗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1203">20:03</a> 马斯克的分道扬镳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1802">30:02</a> 特斯拉与OpenAI的What If</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 伊利亚的羁绊与竞争的残酷现实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2706">45:06</a> 由信仰到利益的考量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3001">50:01</a> 创新的勇气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3305">55:05</a> 增长的诅咒</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【图示说明】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>酬薪基准</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>OpenAI LP的架构</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>大模型的训练成本</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>大模型的参数量</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>黄氏定律下的计算能力</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>黄氏定律下的模型训练成本</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>Ilya在公司外面唱卡拉ok</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>Ilya和Greg谈论AGI</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>在度假中招募OpenAI初始成员</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>Openai创立初期在Greg的公寓办公</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>Ilya离职后和现任团队合影</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><h2><span>【相关材料】</span></h2><span></span><h1><a href="https://www.vox.com/future-perfect/351132/openai-vested-equity-nda-sam-altman-documents-employees" data-url="https://www.vox.com/future-perfect/351132/openai-vested-equity-nda-sam-altman-documents-employees"><span>Leaked OpenAI documents reveal aggressive tactics toward former employees</span></a></h1><span></span><h1><a href="https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/kovCotfpTFWFXaxwi/simeon_c-s-shortform#G97BaFw83cvegttbv" data-url="https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/kovCotfpTFWFXaxwi/simeon_c-s-shortform#G97BaFw83cvegttbv"><span>simeon_c's Shortform</span></a></h1><span></span><h1><a href="https://www.levels.fyi/companies/openai/salaries/software-engineer?sortBy=total_compensation&amp;sortOrder=ASC&amp;country=254" data-url="https://www.levels.fyi/companies/openai/salaries/software-engineer?sortBy=total_compensation&amp;sortOrder=ASC&amp;country=254"><span>OpenAI Software Engineer Salaries</span></a></h1><span></span><h1><a href="https://www.levels.fyi/blog/openai-compensation.html" data-url="https://www.levels.fyi/blog/openai-compensation.html"><span>OpenAI PPUs: How OpenAI's unique equity compensation works</span></a></h1><span></span><h1><a href="https://openai.com/index/openai-lp/" data-url="https://openai.com/index/openai-lp/"><span>OpenAI LP</span></a></h1><span></span><p><a href="https://startup.jobs/director-of-equity-administration-openai-3962743" data-url="https://startup.jobs/director-of-equity-administration-openai-3962743"><span>OPENAI IS HIRING A Director of Equity Administration</span></a></p><span></span><h1><a href="https://openai.com/index/introducing-superalignment/" data-url="https://openai.com/index/introducing-superalignment/"><span>Introducing Superalignment</span></a></h1><span></span><h1><a href="https://www.vox.com/future-perfect/2024/5/17/24158403/openai-resignations-ai-safety-ilya-sutskever-jan-leike-artificial-intelligence" data-url="https://www.vox.com/future-perfect/2024/5/17/24158403/openai-resignations-ai-safety-ilya-sutskever-jan-leike-artificial-intelligence"><span>Why the OpenAI team in charge of safeguarding humanity imploded</span></a></h1><span></span><p><a href="https://www.theinformation.com/articles/openai-researchers-including-ally-of-sutskever-fired-for-alleged-leaking" data-url="https://www.theinformation.com/articles/openai-researchers-including-ally-of-sutskever-fired-for-alleged-leaking"><span>OpenAI Researchers, Including Ally of Sutskever, Fired for Alleged Leaking</span></a></p><span></span><h1><a href="https://forum-bots.effectivealtruism.org/posts/ABz55P4BLca3vxrfE/william_s-s-quick-takes?commentId=B9iTGiCyHdpfpMqe2" data-url="https://forum-bots.effectivealtruism.org/posts/ABz55P4BLca3vxrfE/william_s-s-quick-takes?commentId=B9iTGiCyHdpfpMqe2"><span>William_S's Quick takes</span></a></h1><span></span><p><span>配乐：You Can See It In The Bule - The fin.</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【联系方式】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Daniel微信如下，可加听友群，加好友时希望能加自我介绍和对我们播客的反馈：）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrH5xHDG3dbK_fl507x3rwci0q70.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Julian邮箱：julianaszhiyuan@gmail.com。</span></p>]]></description>
