  <item>
    <title>Trader Joe&apos;s | 披着零售外衣的内容公司</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66447440251bd96e6c7c823e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66447440251bd96e6c7c823e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 15 May 2024 08:37:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>【栏目介绍】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Strait is the gate and narrow is the way.</span></p><span></span><p><span>大部分人随波逐流以消弭不安、渴望坦途，却也总有小部分人超越周围的因果关系、挤进窄门。我们希望对独特事物做最深度的思考。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【主播介绍】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Daniel，缺德舅的潜在消费者，本期策划。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Julian，AI相关产品创业者、前VC投资人，本期剪辑。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【本期起因】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Daniel偶然注意到缺德舅的单位面积销售额甚至高于Costco的时候，他决定研究一下这个神秘的杂货店。由于其只在美国运营所以除了从业者和本国人其实并不为人所知。它的迷人之处在于回答了一个近乎永恒的命题：“如何在同质化严重的领域做出差异化。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>而关于它的研究也并没有国内火热的山姆与Costco那么详细。大家对于它的印象是强大的自有品牌、便宜的价格和狂热的粉丝群体。有关的资料也基本在源于其创始人的传记，这可以解释部分现象。但解释不了为什么它的食物产品力和粉丝粘性如此之高。在深入探究后，我们发现这个策略至今仍只是少数零售商正在实践。而这期播客，我们决定揭开Trader Joe's不为人知的秘密。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【内容索引】</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">1:35</a> Trader Joe's有多厉害</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">4:45</a> 创始人Joe Coulombe的故事</span></p><span></span><h3><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="477">7:57</a> Trader Joe竞争力的秘诀</span></h3><span></span><h3><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="686">11:26</a> Trader Joe's如何定位</span></h3><span></span><h3><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> Trader Joe's主题氛围</span></h3><span></span><h3><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> Trader Joe's真正壁垒的建立</span></h3><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 掌握葡萄酒供应链</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1785">29:45</a> 自有品牌和利基市场的建立</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1965">32:45</a> The Fearless Flyer</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2665">44:25</a> 密集采购</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3169">52:49</a> 产品的不连续性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3405">56:45</a> 产品的差异性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3705">61:45</a> 选址</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3966">66:06</a> 高薪带来的好处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4155">69:15</a> 复式零售</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4461">74:21</a> 产品知识（制造、包装、运输）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4596">76:36</a> Trader Joe's的强内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6201">103:21</a> 更多细节</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【图示说明】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Trader Joe's主要时间线</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>Trader Joe's传记</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>Joe Coulombe和妻子Alice Steere</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>最早期的pronto</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>金融行业刻板印象图</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>第一家商店的照片</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>迷你巧克力片旋涡羊角面包</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>1980年的Joe Coulombe</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>杂货店的铃铛</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>无畏飞人杂志</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>当地手绘壁画</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>Trader Joe's各种设计风格的自有品牌</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>Trader Joe'